{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>For any man who has a blemish shall not draw near.</b> To stand and minister before the Name of HaShem — as in כִּי אֵין לָבוֹא אֶל שַׁעַר הַמֶּלֶךְ בִּלְבוּשׁ שָׂק (Esther 4:2)." "<b>A blind man.</b> These are blemishes present from birth, due to a deficiency of matter or of the formative power."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:12.231343588Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}